<title>USA: Wave says in $5 mln deal with ITG.</title>
<headline>Wave says in $5 mln deal with ITG.</headline>
<dateline>LEE, Mass. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wave Systems Corp said Thursday it licensed its technology for $5 million to Internet Technology Group Plc in a deal that is the biggest in its history.</p>
<p>Wave said it formed a joint venture with the British company to launch its electronic content distribution service in Europe, Africa and the Middle East.</p>
<p>Wave has a 25 percent stake in the joint venture, called Global Wave. Internet Technology will be responsible for funding the joint venture and will control the remaining 75 percent.</p>
</text>
